Neptune's Pride Agent Firefox source submission

This archive includes the web source at the recorded release commit, locked
 dependencies, Firefox wrapper, and the build recipe. No Git checkout or SSH
credentials are needed. build.json records the source commit, version, build
date, expected payload hashes, and Firefox extension ID.

Install Bun INJECT_BUN from https://bun.sh (the version used for this release).
From this directory run:

    bun rebuild.ts

This installs the locked dependencies, builds the production web payload, checks
that intel.js and intel.css exactly match the shared Chrome/iOS release, and
creates output/ containing the unsigned Firefox extension. Zip the contents of
output/ to reproduce the submitted extension (ZIP timestamps may differ).

The Firefox background registers the existing user-script loader and embeds the
locally built script as a data URL so it runs in the game's page context. CSS is
packaged separately. No code is downloaded at runtime. Source maps remain in
dist/ for review and are excluded from the extension package.
